Fixed: refresh/start compares the façade's rendered lists before/after (_show_manifest); own endpoint gets list_changed per changed kind, /all gets tools/prompts via rebuild_aggregate(@changed); unchanged → no notification (worker's choice). Test t/list-changed.t (real listen, stdio+fork, /echo+/all), red on HEAD 4/4. Committed as fbb760b.
